Something's gone wrong either with Nora's reasoning or with your
reporting of it. It is the Collective that is lo pipnybevri.
Neither the supervisor nor each physically active carrier is
lo pipnybevri or loi-Collective pipnybevri.

If lei prenu cu pipnybevri, can the supervisor be included as
a member of lei prenu? Yes, but no member of lei prenu is 
pipnybevri.

